  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&label=Discord&style=plastic&logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>Exline's More Carpets</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组添加了更多地毯！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由玻璃块制成的玻璃地毯。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">还提供染色玻璃地毯和着色玻璃地毯。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圆石、石头和平滑石地毯。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用圆石合成圆石地毯，然后将其放入熔炉中可获得石头地毯。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将石头地毯放入熔炉中可获得平滑石地毯。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">还有草方塊和泥土地毯！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">下载</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-more-carpets/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><s